  "title": "Pasta with Tuna Sauce",
  "description": "This pasta with tuna is perfect for a busy weeknight. Top any pasta shape with canned tuna, tomatoes, garlic, parsley, and lemon juice, and dinner's done!",
  "authors": [
    "Amanda"
  ],
